# Domain & offline data

See `docs/DATA-MODEL.md` and `docs/TRADING-P2P.md`.

- `src/domain/`: pure functions only (no framework imports, no React).
- Pack draw: no duplicate sticker IDs within one pack; use Fisher–Yates.
- Trades: duplicate-only offers; validate `TradePayload` before `applyTrade`.
- localStorage access only via `src/services/db/` repositories.
- Validate remote JSON with Zod before persisting.

Test domain (`drawStickers`, `applyTrade`, cooldown) per `docs/TESTING.md` and `docs/PHASES/04-packs.md`, `05-trading.md`.
